Z||000006||Big O||06-04-2000||09:51 PM||||From the size selection listed I don't think you will have any problem getting a set to fit, my only question is why?  These wheels are so common out there they are like #ssholes and belly buttons, everyones got them.  I sell copies like these for about $65.00 each in chrome plated steel.  WELD is one of the most expensive wheel suppliers out there.  If you want that particular look, more power to you, but shop around and you will find a wheel that looks almost exactly like it from about 6-8 different suppliers a lot cheaper.  Custom wheels should make a statement about the owner, the statement these wheels make to me isn't very impressive.||||reg||1
